      "title": "--- instructions ---",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "clone these into custom nodes (not through manager)\n\ncd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\n\ngit clone --branch release/comfyui-inference --single-branch https://github.com/vita-epfl/PTD-inference ComfyUI-PTD\n\ngit clone https://github.com/Nynxz/ComfyUI-PTD-Compact\n\ngit clone https://github.com/shootthesound/ComfyUI-Fizgig-H3-Still \n\n-----\n* sage-attention works well with this method. (rdna2 and below)\n\n* if you have RDNA3 or newer gpus use \"ck-attention\" instead.\n\n* SLA doesn't work with this because it is just 5 frames to be precise.\nSLA works best with a \"video\" with lots of frames ...\n\n* When starting comfyui shows error with ptd but it works that's not a problem.\n\nDownload these (4 and 8 step \"adapters\" , they are fixed so adapter name also determnines the step count) into comfyui-rocm\\models\\ptd (create ptd folder if not present)\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/nynxz/MiniMax-H3-PTD-LoRAs/blob/main/ptd/ptd_h3_ref2va_4step_int8.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/nynxz/MiniMax-H3-PTD-LoRAs/blob/main/ptd/ptd_h3_ref2va_8step_int8.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/nynxz/MiniMax-H3-PTD-LoRAs/blob/main/ptd/ptd_h3_ref2va_refasymopd_8step_int8.safetensors (alternative 8 steps)\n\nOnce all these are complete you can use this workflow.\n\n(yes this can generate stuff at 2-3 or more megapixels instead of the usual 1 mp or below)\n\n*** USE EITHER THE REF2VA BASE MODEL OR HYBRID BASE MODEL, DO NOT USE MODEL WITH TURBO MERGED ***"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "clone these into custom nodes (not through manager)\n\ncd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\n\ngit clone --branch release/comfyui-inference --single-branch https://github.com/vita-epfl/PTD-inference ComfyUI-PTD\n\ngit clone https://github.com/Nynxz/ComfyUI-PTD-Compact\n\ngit clone https://github.com/shootthesound/ComfyUI-Fizgig-H3-Still \n\n-----\n* sage-attention works well with this method. (rdna2 and below)\n\n* if you have RDNA3 or newer gpus use \"ck-attention\" instead.\n\n* SLA doesn't work with this because it is just 5 frames to be precise.\nSLA works best with a \"video\" with lots of frames ...\n\n* When starting comfyui shows error with ptd but it works that's not a problem.\n\nDownload these (4 and 8 step \"adapters\" , they are fixed so adapter name also determnines the step count) into comfyui-rocm\\models\\ptd (create ptd folder if not present)\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/nynxz/MiniMax-H3-PTD-LoRAs/blob/main/ptd/ptd_h3_ref2va_4step_int8.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/nynxz/MiniMax-H3-PTD-LoRAs/blob/main/ptd/ptd_h3_ref2va_8step_int8.safetensors\nhttps://huggingface.co/nynxz/MiniMax-H3-PTD-LoRAs/blob/main/ptd/ptd_h3_ref2va_refasymopd_8step_int8.safetensors (alternative 8 steps)\n\nOnce all these are complete you can use this workflow.\n\n(yes this can generate stuff at 2-3 or more megapixels instead of the usual 1 mp or below)\n\n*** USE EITHER THE REF2VA BASE MODEL OR HYBRID BASE MODEL, DO NOT USE MODEL WITH TURBO MERGED ***"
      },
